    brief: { zh: "给每个发布制品绑定精确源码、锁定依赖、构建器环境、校验和与签名，用 GNU Guix 做位级可复现构建，把源码存入 Software Heritage，再由第三方独立重建并比对产物哈希。", en: "Bind each released artifact to exact source, locked dependencies, builder environment, checksums and signatures; produce bit-reproducible builds with GNU Guix; archive the source in Software Heritage; then have third parties rebuild independently and compare artifact hashes." },
