    qfocus: { zh: "当 LLM 抹平了「折磨过的短语」这类破绽，还能不能找到可在上亿篇论文上批量运行的造假指纹？", en: "Now that LLMs are erasing tells like “tortured phrases,” can fraud fingerprints still be found that run in batch across hundreds of millions of papers?" },
