    qfocus: { zh: "把文献拆到主张—证据—溯源的粒度后，机器能否区分真矛盾与只是实验语境不同的表面冲突？", en: "Once literature is decomposed to assertion–evidence–provenance units, can a machine tell a real contradiction from a surface conflict that is only a difference of experimental context?" },
