      barrier: { zh: "瓶颈不在 AI 而在原子世界：仪器互操作差、协议不可迁移、大量隐性人工启发式，使绝大多数自驱实验室仍被锁在窄任务里。", en: "The bottleneck is not the AI but the world of atoms: poor instrument interoperability, non-transferable protocols and a mass of tacit hand-built heuristics keep most self-driving labs locked into narrow tasks." },
